ss="r-121x5n4"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R4mr2:"><div data-rid="e0a80310-cad6-41ae-a810-025a72df70a1" class="r-1tt0s0g"><div data-rid="a5e5031d-80f3-4465-a0e3-f9ff6261b7f1" class="r-blsx7b alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>The benefits that most dogs feel—less itching, more activity, better mood—are just bonuses to improving their long-term health. If taken consistently on a daily basis, most dogs will start to see positive effects in about 6-8 weeks.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="f4a95244-b2c1-44b1-8829-4907ac668ec0" class="r-e9lnac" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="66a9f822-3f38-4767-b097-d237f4a2c002" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R5mr2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-bx21oy"><div data-rid="6b7cfdc4-9748-4754-bcb5-c95f995ccb7b" class="r-58kiu4 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>How many chews come in a jar? </p></span></div><div data-rid="3dcfd5ea-a34e-4ee6-acdc-68e712a3387e" class="r-1pvf1z4"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R5mr2:"><div data-rid="51e24d09-7dc3-41ae-9b22-c35baa5bd0b5" class="r-wedk5s"><div data-rid="986a908d-2018-4c7e-a8e8-5248d5844809" class="r-1t0szs3 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>There are <strong>60 Chews in each jar</strong>, which is a monthly supply for all dogs.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="4ed8349e-459a-424d-ac9c-8e4ab59dbaf2" class="r-1sn7g7h" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="cee2ceca-9282-4bdd-9f5d-b565901cac6d" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R6mr2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-12nts5t"><div data-rid="15fdc8fc-a45f-4a7d-8a06-c5c9751f02e6" class="r-1h5mqlj alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>What flavour is the Multivitamin?</p></span></div><div data-rid="5c339421-1e20-455d-83bc-b4b61e7ddc7c" class="r-m8euiw"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R6mr2:"><div data-rid="3a6f914e-b0f1-4509-aacb-0dfe60abd9c1" class="r-xqgl9r"><div data-rid="82ab1610-4dcd-4cee-bcda-415da6ef7aeb" class="r-uo7887 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Our Multivitamin is made with the highest quality human-grade duck meat, a flavour that dogs absolutely love.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="4aee95f0-8d89-433c-a2c5-3d3bb90cd074" class="r-wzeiv0" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="9f7f1177-4bfe-4718-9346-737079dffb1a" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R7mr2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-rji7oo"><div data-rid="a7d610db-0b79-4470-b9d6-fad702f0d005" class="r-u2ie56 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>What happens if I accidentally give my dog too many chews? </p></span></div><div data-rid="1e454a99-de68-4bb6-923e-e9bc4994f65b" class="r-106tdkh"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R7mr2:"><div data-rid="428a0610-6398-4609-a6e4-9c97b5c3632d" class="r-1f5mrdg"><div data-rid="6703032b-43c0-49bb-86ff-68e226c5569d" class="r-lo5aka alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>In the event that your dog accidentally consumes significantly more than the daily recommended dose, consult your vet for advice.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="38cee052-a875-44e5-a2b7-c4533b1dfdca" class="r-13e49o4" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="78803ae7-b8bb-4a11-90b4-c6aad71a976c" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R8mr2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1hyq9hy"><div data-rid="5e752b2d-a929-4238-9127-fd883dec1c26" class="r-s1uapj alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Can I take this dog multivitamin with other supplements? </p></span></div><div data-rid="56a1cbce-70cf-4618-abce-d389d03d24da" class="r-f4x14e"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R8mr2:"><div data-rid="9ba942c4-e3bb-45af-9e4c-fdc065d55e38" class="r-5c5brb"><div data-rid="f85d4231-7882-4294-b58d-3bff5d4494e6" class="r-1cupy2b alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Our veterinary team formulated our Daily Vitamin with natural ingredients that can be taken both alone or as a complementary product with other common and more targeted pet supplements. Nevertheless, we still recommend checking with your vet.</p></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><style>@import url(https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@100;200;300;400;500;600;700;800;900;950)</style></div>
